1224
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:29,050
What was that?

1225
00:09:29,590 --> 00:09:32,430
She was with one of my previous partners.

1226
00:09:33,010 --> 00:09:37,140
It's common to get trouble
 from a dead partner's loved ones.

1227
00:09:37,140 --> 00:09:40,940
She doesn't have the power to kill the devil,
 so she takes it out on me.

1228
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:46,650
Well, I tend to just think of it
 as part of a devil hunter's job.

1229
00:09:55,700 --> 00:09:57,160
What did you do?

1230
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:04,670
I secretly stuck some gum to her clothes.

1231
00:10:06,670 --> 00:10:07,750
What?!

1232
00:10:08,090 --> 00:10:10,090
She got what she deserved.

1233
00:10:10,090 --> 00:10:13,180
It's not about you. She just annoyed me.

1234
00:10:13,180 --> 00:10:14,760
So I got back at her.

1235
00:10:15,220 --> 00:10:16,260
Serves her right.

1236
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:20,020
She'll go on with her life without noticing the gum.

