00:10:26,690 --> 00:10:29,690


1399
00:10:28,110 --> 00:10:30,610
Well, you know, my teacher once told me this.

1400
00:10:28,110 --> 00:10:31,110


1401
00:10:28,110 --> 00:10:31,110


1402
00:10:30,940 --> 00:10:36,410
It's not the strongest or bravest hunters
 that the devils fear most.

1403
00:10:36,410 --> 00:10:39,120
It's the crazy ones.

1404
00:10:39,540 --> 00:10:42,200
So I think you'll survive for longer.

1405
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,540
Is that sarcasm?

1406
00:10:45,540 --> 00:10:48,170
I'll take your dessert if you're not eating it.

1407
00:10:51,130 --> 00:10:52,880
You can have this.

1408
00:10:54,220 --> 00:10:56,180
They erode the bones.

1409
00:10:56,180 --> 00:10:57,390
Really?

1410
00:10:57,720 --> 00:11:01,850
Looks like we're going to be together
 for quite a while, so it'd be nice if you smoked too.

1411
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:13,240
Fine, I'll smoke <i>one</i>.

1412
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:16,530
And this will be the only one I smoke with you.

1413
00:11:18,740 --> 00:11:21,240
Himeno, do you have any smokes left?

1414
00:11:21,580 --> 00:11:24,250
Sorry. This is the last one.

1415
00:11:24,620 --> 00:11:26,790
Then let me have it.

1416
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:27,880
Really?

1417
00:11:28,580 --> 00:11:30,540
Okay, I guess.

1418
00:11:32,380 --> 00:11:33,300
That's a kiss!

1419
00:11:33,300 --> 00:11:33,960
No fair!

1420
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:35,130
An indirect kiss!

1421
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:36,590
Shut up.

1422
00:11:40,140 --> 00:11:41,720
I have bad news.

1423
00:11:42,770 --> 00:11:44,770
We killed a devil, right?

1424
00:11:44,770 --> 00:11:46,890
The one I killed!

1425
00:11:47,310 --> 00:11:50,150
It's growing bigger.

1426
00:12:01,700 --> 00:12:04,120
I'm sure I killed it.

1427
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:06,460
It can't get out of the hotel.

1428
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:08,120
I've never seen such a shape.

1429
00:12:08,710 --> 00:12:10,460
What devil is this?

1430
00:12:11,380 --> 00:12:12,500
Humans!

1431
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:14,340
Hear me, humans.

1432
00:12:14,340 --> 00:12:16,260
Hear me, foolish humans.

1433
00:12:16,260 --> 00:12:18,760
I wish to negotiate a contract.

1434
00:12:19,090 --> 00:12:20,390
It talks!

1435
00:12:20,390 --> 00:12:21,390
A contract?

1436
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:25,350
Let me eat the human you call Denji.

1437
00:12:25,350 --> 00:12:27,180
I don't mind if he's dead.

1438
00:12:27,180 --> 00:12:28,640
Let me eat him.

1439
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:33,270
If you do, I shall let all the other
 devil hunters exit unharmed.

1440
00:12:33,270 --> 00:12:35,030
Exit unharmed.

1441
00:12:35,030 --> 00:12:36,780
Make the contract!

1442
00:12:37,110 --> 00:12:38,200
Make the contract!

1443
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:38,780
Make the contract!

1444
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:50,370
Denji.

1445
00:12:50,370 --> 00:12:51,750
Get eaten.

1446
00:13:18,740 --> 00:13:20,280
Keep it down, will ya?

1447
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:23,620
Aki, can't you just have the Fox swallow it and get this over with?

1448
00:13:24,410 --> 00:13:25,080
Yip.

1449
00:13:27,490 --> 00:13:29,790
Seems like the Fox can't get here,

1450
00:13:29,790 --> 00:13:32,120
because this space is isolated from the outside.

1451
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:35,090
Yeah, its body is all the way in Kyoto.

1452
00:13:35,420 --> 00:13:38,170
Guess I'll use my Ghost then.

1453
00:13:50,930 --> 00:13:51,940
Ugh!

1454
00:13:51,940 --> 00:13:53,480
It got bigger.

1455
00:13:54,690 --> 00:13:55,940
It's no use.

1456
00:13:55,940 --> 00:13:59,190
This is not my actual body.

1457
00:13:59,190 --> 00:14:01,950
My heart isn't here.

1458
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:03,950
This is the inside of my belly.

1459
00:14:03,950 --> 00:14:04,030
This is the inside of my belly.

1460
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:04,110
This is the inside of my belly.

1461
00:14:04,410 --> 00:14:08,200
My weak point is not on the eighth floor.

1462
00:14:08,540 --> 00:14:12,210
The only way to get out alive
 is to make the contract.

1463
00:14:12,210 --> 00:14:13,580
Hmph!

1464
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:17,250
It's not like you'll actually let them out after you kill me.

1465
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:18,710
You're wrong.

1466
00:14:18,710 --> 00:14:22,170
It's saying "contract", right?

1467
00:14:22,170 --> 00:14:26,220
When a devil uses the word "contract",
 that holds great power.

1468
00:14:26,510 --> 00:14:31,730
If one side upholds their end,
 the other is also forced to.

1469
00:14:32,060 --> 00:14:34,350
If they don't, they die.

1470
00:14:34,350 --> 00:14:37,650
So there's no doubt
 it would let us out if we gave you to it.

1471
00:14:38,230 --> 00:14:41,490
Himeno, we should kill him.

1472
00:14:42,070 --> 00:14:45,990
After that's done and we're out, we can consider our options.

1473
00:14:45,990 --> 00:14:48,740
Otherwise we'll all just starve to death in here.

1474
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:53,370
It's even allowed by law for hunters
 to make contracts with devils.

1475
00:14:53,750 --> 00:14:56,000
We should make that contract!

1476
00:14:56,420 --> 00:14:59,210
The devil wants to kill Denji.

1477
00:14:59,210 --> 00:15:02,010
That means Denji's death
 would be to the devil's advantage.

1478
00:15:02,550 --> 00:15:04,340
So we can't agree to it.

1479
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:05,880
I'm with Aki, then.

1480
00:15:06,470 --> 00:15:07,680
Really?!

1481
00:15:07,680 --> 00:15:09,390
I'm for killing him!

1482
00:15:09,390 --> 00:15:10,390
For real?

1483
00:15:10,390 --> 00:15:15,190
Even if I come up with a Nobel prize,
 I can't announce it unless I get out.

1484
00:15:15,190 --> 00:15:16,850
Die for my Nobel!

1485
00:15:16,850 --> 00:15:19,770
A fiend cannot form a contract with a devil.

1486
00:15:19,770 --> 00:15:23,860
So if you kill Denji, the devil won't be forced to let us out.

1487
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,450
In any case, we're not killing him.

1488
00:15:26,450 --> 00:15:28,370
We're devil hunters.

1489
00:15:29,070 --> 00:15:31,120
We only kill devils.

1490
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:32,080
Tch.

1491
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:35,460
I'm bored. Let's sumo wrestle!

1492
00:15:35,460 --> 00:15:37,620
I don't wanna play after you said to kill me!

1493
00:15:44,510 --> 00:15:45,970
I'm hungry.

1494
00:15:45,970 --> 00:15:50,140
Aki, do you actually have a plan for how to get out?

1495
00:15:50,140 --> 00:15:54,640
If we trust what it says, that means we can't kill it.

1496
00:15:54,930 --> 00:15:57,390
But I don't intend to kill Denji either.

1497
00:15:57,810 --> 00:16:00,150
But we're going to starve unless we do something.

1498
00:16:03,690 --> 00:16:05,990
If we run out of options, I'll use the sword.

1499
00:16:05,990 --> 00:16:07,150
That's not an option.

1500
00:16:08,780 --> 00:16:12,780
If using the sword would solve this,
 why don't you do it?

1501
00:16:13,910 --> 00:16:16,790
Even if we run out of options,
 we're not using the sword.

1502
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:19,670
If we get to that point, I'm sorry, but...

1503
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,670
you'll have to die.

1504
00:16:22,210 --> 00:16:23,920
What?

1505
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:25,670
Gone?!

1506
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:27,050
It's gone!

1507
00:16:27,050 --> 00:16:30,430
All the food we left on the bed is gone!

1508
00:16:30,970 --> 00:16:31,800
How?

1509
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:40,230
Did you eat all of it?!

1510
00:16:40,230 --> 00:16:42,690
It wasn't me. It was Denji.

1511
00:16:42,690 --> 00:16:44,820
That's an obvious lie!

1512
00:16:44,820 --> 00:16:46,190
I get it!

1513
00:16:46,190 --> 00:16:49,200
I finally get it!

1514
00:16:49,950 --> 00:16:53,910
It's that fiend's ability that's trapping us here!

1515
00:16:53,910 --> 00:16:55,580
I'm sure of it!

1516
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:56,580
Nope.

1517
00:16:56,580 --> 00:16:58,250
Calm down, Kobeni!

1518
00:16:58,250 --> 00:16:59,330
She's the Blood Fiend!

1519
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:01,420
You're taking a fiend's side?

1520
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:03,840
We're supposed to be devil hunters!

1521
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:07,010
Arai, you're on their side!

1522
00:17:07,010 --> 00:17:08,970
You were a spy all along!

1523
00:17:08,970 --> 00:17:10,220
He's a pie?

1524
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:12,640
I-I'm not on their side...

1525
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:16,220
You're definitely a spy!

1526
00:17:20,940 --> 00:17:22,060
A scream?

1527
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:23,480
Himeno, run!

1528
00:17:32,530 --> 00:17:36,160
Kill Denji and give me his heart!

1529
